  "description": "Free service .NET SDK for secure software licensing. Supports perpetual, trial, subscription, node-locked, floating, concurrent, and metered (credit-based / usage-based) license models with RSA signature verification, hardware binding, and seamless Dashboard integration. Now includes auto-update and rollback capabilities.",
