  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Sessions now auto-disconnect when the host application exits (ProcessExit / Ctrl+C), so active sessions are released in real time without requiring an explicit DisconnectAsync/DisposeAsync call. Previous (1.8.0): Metered licensing — MeteredToken (credit-based) and MeteredCount (usage-based) license types (always-online), MeteredTokenLicense/MeteredCountLicense payloads, MeterManager.ConsumeAsync/GetBalanceAsync and LicenseClient.ConsumeAsync/GetBalanceAsync (POST /api/meter/consume, GET /api/meter/balance) returning MeterConsumeResult/MeterBalanceResult.",
